{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dbd521fece83d18c444d6f206fadfc7867c7058b8c48869107b7790d6ab22b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce89806573cb24de3f996803fe878444be7e26477427c571a2e074482365b77",
      "text": "像自己，像我们自己",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83cbac4e0f6baf974c7017deef4aa25341b763eb4f3a8f3481ad6a517f4664d",
      "text": "获得了参加名为《大扫除解决队》的电视节目\n出演试镜机会的Legenders。\n然而，未能取得十分满意结果的3人\n重新确认起组合的魅力……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce89806573cb24de3f996803fe878444be7e26477427c571a2e074482365b77",
      "text": "像自己，像我们自己",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e1a2e0f61eb73a7aabb2f2610bdc261ea0d0bf544da5577d9e259aeecde5ab",
      "text": "早上好～……啊，抱歉。\n正在开会中吗～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:850d449cf4ad3fde4133826f7e4f73f40523e39761eb64d321fd7ea29228a72d",
      "text": "早上好，想乐先生。\n还有，Legenders的各位也到齐了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e86572b7a38c96c32909c01c8c9b7e0a08086c7dbe8d468da87d83f862dda4ea",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，早上好。\n……哎呀？旁边那位是。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fdf6b166bcb994a9e34de7c2c6516620e9caffceb16005deb6f7cc0b49431b",
      "text": "这位是协助W制作视频的\n导播先生。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adebacb60a87749a34449c571d2f15effe44e3c7b2b3a88068d416e74a27fc77",
      "text": "啊啊，就是前阵子的“24小时颠球”吗。\n听说评价相当高呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b1b8b2ef336d35ec097e9a1dd8e61ff228d6d57a97eb821c70e17c7e4f76e1",
      "text": "是的。所以刚才正和导播先生一起，\n构思下次的视频企划。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f9c243c0ea1d3bdc87257a5b929bd272b954ff0d51711150a969bf1afc9a821",
      "text": "想乘着这股势头，\n大张旗鼓地宣传我们嘛，",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:070aafe90ae5b6c035a3a92dd99fdbe714ea5a0d4487af0aec67c0601998e4ce",
      "text": "大家把各自的点子拿出来，\n聊得可起劲了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59502cec6a8deed94bfa766436070fa9798634c0d01631ab56ce2920a7651cd7",
      "text": "比如模仿漫画里的必杀技射门啦，\n或者去给粉丝们当足球教练啦♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afbb51b06bfeb70025d60520d78f861050f21f728201a2cf2c3a6d87a0b33e17",
      "text": "听起来都很有趣呢！……哎呀，\nW的两位，差不多到下一个预定安排的时间了哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbb50c49c79a872d3d1e61d4bce6eaca12684545bc988c080556d909c34efbf0",
      "text": "OK！●●●●●●●●●●监督，后面就交给你啦。\n悠介，剩下的在路上边走边想吧♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a93c070b39eef31b5756b7b82989c33c8c61b8aaa71281c7835a9c5d658e4c53",
      "text": "言语交锋处，可见意气扬。\n两个人都干劲十足呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d25362639608877104bd8f4ed47fbab84440bb5b7efc4c00b8a88e57b8781ff",
      "text": "是的。托他们的福，315频道的观众也\n明显增加了很多。但是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbf5b970077d2c9aa9cc6dc57b0cc9690550bafdd6f10de070e4bbe501f7ab1",
      "text": "想要参加JIF，还需要更高的认知度才行。\n比如，在热门电视节目中出演……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aee0193767af09f0d586c5e41c02e297a9af29f55ebdd44e94b69bda614001f",
      "text": "～♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf1dc8ac05ddef1ac7ac5c12846388c8c92b9ef71df0c4370b78ed21e4adb41",
      "text": "好的！接下来是《大扫除解决队》板块！\n在这个板块中……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
